<title>INDIA: Bombay stocks-recent FII equity trading volumes.</title>
<headline>Bombay stocks-recent FII equity trading volumes.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover figures for purchases and sales of shares on the Bombay bourse by foreign institutional investors (FIIs) are as follows:</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			  on Aug 1, 1997   total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		     450		   203,710</p>
<p> Sales			   180		    89,340</p>
<p> Net			     270		   114,370</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			 on July 31, 1997  total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		     130		   203,260</p>
<p> Sales			    80		    89,160</p>
<p> Net				50		   114,100</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			 on July 30, 1997  total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		     520		   203,130</p>
<p> Sales			   380		    89,080</p>
<p> Net			     140		   114,050</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			 on July 29, 1997  total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		     270		   202,610</p>
<p> Sales			   240		    88,700</p>
<p> Net				30		   113,910</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------- Note : The above FII figures are provisional</p>
<p>Source: Bombay Stock Exchange</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
